<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-11T16:49:21.305Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 16:49:21 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Chinese Coast Guard vessels have used water cannons to block Philippine Coast Guard ships conducting medical evacuations at Ayungin Shoal, near Ren’ai Jiao, and in the Luzon Strait, and fired on a PCG ship during a medevac of a navy serviceman. Philippine Coast Guard, Marine Corps and Navy forces have jointly repelled Chinese militia vessels and 22 sampans that intruded into the territorial sea of Kota Island. China has warned the Philippines to stop its alleged infringements after a PCG vessel transported an injured person from a grounded ship near Ren’ai. 176 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOaXFxYXNELTRqeU1fUE45MW5uc2pXWGZ0dTRFWXJfRTlMRXBEUEk3X3RiVXJieVVBWG54b3VVOVVhRF9lWnNfS090VDAtbElUT3B3TmVjc0NjM3FaQWszUVk0cHZCNEJKYnpjZFVnZkwyRFMxUXlvZGoxVl9ock5YN2V4VzlSUy1CUjVUak5fV1lmT1pOcGRmcGU2MGE2WUhlLThkRmlwbkVsVWZINWc4WTZQTHhBRHdRRmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPVE9MVUNXZ3V1TGp3SDRheFBHV0tQRWhobGhwQ0QtQllseE85aWZjWHNGaXpRS0dkbG5jeEhvTFVOVjZNdEVFdEJzNnU5MzV1U0VQQzdOLVFjSjdyWGtQUHZMN1B1QlhmZVdwLWFreURvUFdFZDU2S010ckJBZHZ4Um9BNG0waUhrY0doU3JJUllmTGRqT2t0bTRWb1ZlYzBRU05pekhVZWNaUms?oc=5&quot;&gt;Indo-Pacific Defense FORUM&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNYTYzQm1aSi1fcG9SajZEV2R2TklqREoxQW5WbW44OS0taDJXMURLVnF2SlkwLUpmLW9PazUzNW5zNmVIeUNFdjNOQWI3cGR0bFh5dG1XU0ItOVZ5SFR3ZDlqZElDTDY1SWhBWXBOWTlSdXQyLXg2SG54UEhBdjA3V0syQ3Q2a3NNSEhyQkx3amlOTFdLM2FUQVhR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Inquirer.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;GMA Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Philstar.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE1pN0x